{"seq":3,"slug":"business-negotiation","title":"商务谈判","stage":"DONE","category":"negotiation-communication","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.16,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 商务谈判\n\n商务谈判是将谈判理论和沟通心理学应用于真实商业场景的实战领域。与抽象的谈判原则不同，商务谈判直面具体的利益博弈：一份合同的价格条款如何敲定、一次并购中的风险如何分配、一场薪资谈判中如何为自己争取最大价值。掌握商务谈判的系统方法，意味着从\"凭经验应对\"转变为\"有框架决策\"，在每一次商业互动中做到心中有数、进退有据。\n\n本 Hub 从四个维度覆盖商务谈判的核心能力：首先是谈判准备与策略，包括系统化的谈判规划、信息收集与对手分析、以及团队谈判的组织方法——准备阶段决定了谈判 80% 的结果；其次是交易达成，涵盖开价策略、价值创造与交易结构设计、以及成交技巧；第三部分聚焦合同谈判，从条款清单谈判到风险分配再到交易后管理，覆盖商务交易的法律与商业条款协商；最后是薪资与职业谈判，将商务谈判技能应用于个人职业发展的关键场景——薪资协商、晋升争取和自由职业定价。\n\n无论你是参与 B2B 采购的业务经理、负责投资条款的创业者、准备跳槽谈薪的职场人士，还是刚踏入商业世界的新人，本 Hub 都将为你提供从准备到成交的完整实战知识体系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"preparation-strategy","title":"谈判准备与策略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/preparation-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"negotiation-planning","title":"谈判准备与规划 Negotiation Planning and Preparation","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/preparation-strategy/negotiation-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-gathering","title":"信息收集与对手分析 Information Gathering and Counterpart Analysis","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/preparation-strategy/information-gathering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"team-negotiation","title":"团队谈判策略 Team Negotiation Strategy","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/preparation-strategy/team-negotiation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"deal-making","title":"交易达成","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/deal-making","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opening-offers","title":"开价策略与首轮博弈 Opening Offers and First-Round Dynamics","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/deal-making/opening-offers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"value-creation","title":"价值创造与交易结构 Value Creation and Deal Structure","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/deal-making/value-creation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"closing-techniques","title":"成交技巧 Closing Techniques","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/deal-making/closing-techniques"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-negotiation","title":"合同谈判","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/contract-negotiation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"term-sheet-negotiation","title":"条款清单谈判 Term Sheet Negotiation","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/contract-negotiation/term-sheet-negotiation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-allocation","title":"风险分配与保护条款 Risk Allocation and Protective Provisions","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/contract-negotiation/risk-allocation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-deal-management","title":"交易后管理 Post-Deal Management","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/contract-negotiation/post-deal-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"salary-career","title":"薪资与职业谈判","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/salary-career","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"salary-negotiation","title":"薪资谈判 Salary Negotiation","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/salary-career/salary-negotiation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"promotion-negotiation","title":"晋升与资源争取 Promotion and Resource Negotiation","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/salary-career/promotion-negotiation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"freelance-consulting","title":"自由职业与咨询定价 Freelance and Consulting Pricing","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/business-negotiation/salary-career/freelance-consulting"}]}]}